        dct:description "k_c, wavelengths, Pearson r, KS, angles — datasets/cooksonia_pertoni_turing_wavelength_s0/cooksonia_pertoni_turing_wavelength_s0_metrics.json: rendered output of models/2026-delphi10000-cooksonia-pertoni-turing-wavelength-s0.py at 8308af02867b4125a973e632c1b5c530ef0ddf71, application/json, 4310 B, artifact_sha256 2d7fae73061af6811045ff3586bf0bed44f7cab65f98a4401496fd5d2e226197 (sha256 2d7fae73061af6811045ff3586bf0bed44f7cab65f98a4401496fd5d2e226197), spec_fingerprint ce7d40be6d01f3179ec22b3cb8fbb558f6f40b6cad5c716ca069f671182a9ec4" .
